mission "A Convenient Forgery"
    name "A Convenient Forgery"
    description "Confront the broker selling false royal instruments and learn who paid him."
    source "Wreckers' Moon"
    destination "Gallows Key"
    reward 1005
    speaker offer "Silas Rook"
    speaker visit "Silas Rook"
    speaker complete "Silas Rook"
    to offer
        has "The Sound Beneath the Soundings: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Confront the broker selling false royal instruments and learn who paid him.`
            `Silas Rook studies you for a moment. "The old sea charter settled one war, but it did not settle the past. The lost expedition sailed west under a sealed order, and its wake is stirring every ambitious captain in these waters."
            choice
                `(I will help uncover what happened.)`
                    accept
                `(Tell me what you are not saying.)`
                    goto details
                `(I have no wish to be drawn into another quarrel.)`
                    close
            label details
                `Silas Rook lowers their voice. "The maps were altered, the convoy erased from the books, and someone has been buying witnesses. Follow the evidence, not the flags."`
                choice
                    `(Then I will take the matter in hand.)`
                        accept
                    `(Not today.)`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Convenient Forgery. Confront the broker selling false royal instruments and learn who paid him."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Silas Rook receives you at Gallows Key. The evidence fits another piece into the puzzle: the expedition was not searching for gold alone, but for a place deliberately removed from every official chart.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Silas Rook thanks you. "Every answer makes the sea less simple, captain. Yet the truth belongs to the people who live here, not to the first crown or company that can put a seal upon it."`
        log "Completed A Convenient Forgery. Received 1005 gold. Confront the broker selling false royal instruments and learn who paid him."
